# Scoped to web/ deliberately, rather than adding these to the repo-root
# .gitignore: they are artifacts of this project's toolchain, and the root file
# should not have to know that web/ happens to be built by Gren + Vite.

# Gren compiler cache (.greni/.greno interface + object files, per compiler
# version). Regenerated by `gren make`; machine- and version-specific.
.gren/

# Vite output.
dist/

# NOT ignored, on purpose: gren_packages/
#
# ADR-0001 requires it to be committed — "Since Gren 25S, resolved dependencies
# vendor as .pkg.gz bundles in this folder specifically so projects compile
# without network access — CI and every fresh clone benefit." 264 KB buys a
# build that cannot break because the package registry is down, and it makes a
# dependency change show up as a reviewable diff instead of a silent resolution.
